name: sim.removeVoxelsFromOctree
description: Removes voxels from an OC tree
luaSynopsis: int totalVoxelCnt = sim.removeVoxelsFromOctree(int octreeHandle, int options, list points)
pythonSynopsis: int totalVoxelCnt = sim.removeVoxelsFromOctree(int octreeHandle, int options, float[] points)
inputs:
1. octreeHandle: handle of the OC tree
2. options: bit-coded:
    - bit0 set (1): specified points are relative to the OC tree reference frame, otherwise they are relative to the world reference frame
3. points: voxel positions specified as x/y/z coordinates. Set to None/nil to remove all voxels
outputs:
1. totalVoxelCnt: total number of voxels in the OC tree
replacedBy:
- name: subtractVoxels, class: ocTree, file: ocTree_subtractVoxels.method
- name: subtractPackedVoxels, class: ocTree, file: ocTree_subtractPackedVoxels.method
- name: clear, class: ocTree, file: ocTree_clear.method
